# The Wails CLI rewrites generated bindings and the NSIS templates on every
# build using LF, while core.autocrlf wants CRLF in the working tree. Without
# this, those files show as modified after every build even though not one
# character of content changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.exe  binary
*.syso binary
*.woff2 binary
